  title="Terms | ChargeVia by Rangeway"
  description="Terms for using the ChargeVia by Rangeway website."
>
  <div class="wrap legal">
    <div class="legal__inner">
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <p class="lede">This website introduces ChargeVia by Rangeway. It is informational and does not sell charging services or accept payments.</p>
      <h2>Website content</h2>
      <p class="body">The words and concept renderings on this site describe our intended brand and experience. Plans and details may change as the work develops.</p>
      <h2>Using the site</h2>
      <p class="body">You may browse and share links to this site. ChargeVia names, marks, imagery, and other original content may not be copied or presented as someone else&rsquo;s work.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p class="body">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@chargevia.net">hello@chargevia.net</a>. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy notice</a> for information about messages you send.</p>
      <h2>No warranties</h2>
      <p class="body">This site is provided as-is. Statements about ChargeVia describe current intent and may change.</p>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: July 30, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
